cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version-specific archived release."
title: "Alpaca Analysis: Corpus Curation and Spatiotemporal Analysis Workflows for Alpaca Vocalization Research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ariza
    given-names: Daniel
abstract: >-
  Research software for cleaning and deduplicating an alpaca hum corpus,
  preparing reproducible research datasets, and running H1/H2 statistical
  workflows that link vocalization timing with GPS-derived movement and group
  dispersion measures.
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23599881
date-released: 2026-10-23
